# Changelog

## 1.0.0 (2026-09-25)

First public release, under the new name **Sign Manager** (formerly sub-label-pos).

- Native installers built with Briefcase: Windows .msi/.zip, macOS .dmg (Apple Silicon),
  and Ubuntu .deb, Fedora .rpm and Arch .pkg.tar.zst packages that pull in mpv and ffmpeg.
- On Windows x64 and macOS arm64, mpv and ffmpeg are downloaded once on first run
  (checked against pinned SHA-256s) into the per-user data folder.
- No console windows flash on Windows while frames are extracted.
- Settings carry over from sub-label-pos.
- `--version`, `--self-test [--report FILE]`, `--install-runtime-deps` and `--quit-after SECONDS`.
